If there's somebody
you'd like me to profile,

00:12:27.246 --> 00:12:28.722
in our future Top Ten,

00:12:28.722 --> 00:12:30.938
please check out the link
down, in the description below,

00:12:30.938 --> 00:12:34.305
and you can cast your vote,
on who we should do next.

00:12:34.305 --> 00:12:36.425
I also want to give a quick
shout out, to Katie Horrell.

00:12:36.425 --> 00:12:38.840
Katie, thank you so much, for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:41.510
Your One Word, and working on the review,

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:42.753
for your channel as well.

00:12:42.753 --> 00:12:44.822
I really, really, really
appreciate the support,

00:12:44.822 --> 00:12:46.684
and I'm so glad that
you enjoyed the reading.

00:12:46.684 --> 00:12:47.978
Thank you guys, again, for watching!

00:12:47.978 --> 00:12:49.140
I believe in you!

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:51.144
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself,

00:12:51.144 --> 00:12:53.254
and whatever your one word is.

00:12:53.254 --> 00:12:55.671
Much love, I'll see you soon.

00:13:01.482 --> 00:13:03.839
- Everything that happened,
is just like a blessing,

00:13:03.839 --> 00:13:06.224
and being so incredibly fortunate to have,

00:13:06.224 --> 00:13:07.716
be in the right place, at the right time,

00:13:07.716 --> 00:13:09.897
and have all those things, and everything.

00:13:09.897 --> 00:13:13.365
But, in addition to that, if
you don't believe in yourself,

00:13:13.365 --> 00:13:16.883
you won't get to that stage,
of you even writing a song.

00:13:16.883 --> 00:13:18.635
Or, saying I'm going to do this,

00:13:18.635 --> 00:13:21.391
as opposed to just saying,
well, I'd like to be a singer,

00:13:21.391 --> 00:13:23.383
but, you know, probably that won't happen,

00:13:23.383 --> 00:13:25.460
'cause so many people want to do it.

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:27.832
Why should I think I'm special?

00:13:27.832 --> 00:13:29.738
Having someone tell you
that you are special,

00:13:29.738 --> 00:13:33.082
and that you can do it, is a big thing.

00:13:33.082 --> 00:13:35.514
- How you write a song?

00:13:35.514 --> 00:13:39.291
You starting with music, you
starting with ideas for lyrics,

00:13:39.291 --> 00:13:41.320
chorus first, verses first?

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:42.837
- It's always different.

00:13:42.837 --> 00:13:46.716
There are times, when a melody
and a lyric will come to me,

00:13:46.716 --> 00:13:47.970
and they're attached.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.331
It'll happen, it'll be
the inception of an idea,

00:13:50.331 --> 00:13:51.870
and then I'll continue it.

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:54.087
Hero was, and we're going back but,

00:13:54.087 --> 00:13:56.132
they asked me to write
a song, for this movie.

00:13:56.132 --> 00:13:58.651
It was for Gloria Estefan,
supposedly, to sing.

00:13:58.651 --> 00:14:00.376
And I don't know if
Gloria knows that, or not.

00:14:00.376 --> 00:14:04.318
♫ And then a hero comes along ♫

00:14:04.318 --> 00:14:05.723
I left the room, when
I was with Walter Ray,

00:14:05.723 --> 00:14:07.169
who I used to collaborate with.

00:14:07.169 --> 00:14:08.958
I took a walk, came back, and I was like,

00:14:08.958 --> 00:14:10.409
oh no, here's how it goes,

00:14:10.409 --> 00:14:12.554
♫ And then a hero comes along ♫

00:14:12.554 --> 00:14:14.915
And I started telling
him, like, play this,

00:14:14.915 --> 00:14:16.123
and here is what it is.

00:14:16.123 --> 00:14:18.228
So, sometimes it'll be like that.

00:14:18.228 --> 00:14:21.527
Unplugged was, really, like
the first concert-concert,

00:14:21.527 --> 00:14:22.861
I'd ever done,

00:14:22.861 --> 00:14:26.235
and people were waiting to
hear like, can she do this?

00:14:26.235 --> 00:14:28.644
So, that's why there was
that type of pressure.

00:14:28.644 --> 00:14:31.019
I was nervous, 'cause I
had so many high notes in,

00:14:31.019 --> 00:14:34.769
and it really requires
me, to isolate myself,

00:14:35.742 --> 00:14:38.434
and just be on vocal rest, and not speak,

00:14:38.434 --> 00:14:41.104
and be in a well-humidified room,

00:14:41.104 --> 00:14:42.912
and sleep as much as possible,

00:14:42.912 --> 00:14:45.367
'cause people want to
come hear me sound right.

00:14:45.367 --> 00:14:48.084
I'm not going to go out
there, and be a mess.

00:14:48.084 --> 00:14:49.761
(Mariah chuckling)

